	(descr "Hirose FH35C-15S-0.3SHW(50) FPC connector, 15 contacts 0.3 pitch in two staggered rows (w1_hirose_fh35c_series_catalog.pdf p3 dimensions A 6.1, B 3.6, C 4.2, p4 recommended land: pads 0.3 wide, 7 pads 0.65 long at 0.6 pitch (even pins) and 8 pads 0.8 long at 0.6 pitch (odd pins), rows 3.6 apart outer edge to outer edge, two metal-fitting pads 0.4 x 0.95 each 0.5 from the end pad centre; w1_hirose_fh35c-15s-0.3shw50_drawing.pdf p1: pin 1 is the right end of the odd row, pin 2 the right end of the even row, numbering goes left with 0.3 steps). Courtyard (W2, design/wiring/ring-board-plan.md f.4 and h.1): the closed housing, A 6.1 along the contact row (catalogue p3) by depth (3.35) (catalogue p3 top view, lever closed; the (4.2) of the p3 detail drawing is the lever standing open, only while the tail is plugged in before assembly), centred on the land pattern, and widened in depth to the outer land edges, B 3.6 (catalogue p4), because the land rows reach 0.125 beyond the 3.35 housing on each side: 6.1 x 3.6. Pads MP are the two mounting pads (no signal)")
